#!/usr/bin/python3
"""miniqubes-gui - a simple window for your qubes (boxes).

Permissions (sound, camera) are off unless you turn them on for each qube.

Make a qube, open programs in it, pick how locked down it is. No typing commands.

Install:  sudo pacman -S --needed pyside6
          sudo install -m755 miniqubes miniqubes-gui /usr/local/bin/
Run:      miniqubes-gui

Base system actions (set up, install programs, update) open a terminal so sudo can ask for your password.
"""
